WEBVTT

00:07.665 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:36.665 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

01:39.625 --> 01:41.625
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

01:45.825 --> 01:49.625
From now on, I want nails like Lumi's.

01:49.705 --> 01:50.865
Sharp nails.

01:50.945 --> 01:52.585
If someone bullies me,

01:52.665 --> 01:54.505
-I'll scratch them.
-Scratch them!

01:54.585 --> 01:55.905
-Scratch them.
-Yes.

01:57.025 --> 01:58.145
I'll raise my glass.

01:58.225 --> 02:01.705
Today, not only did I defeat
the scummy agency,

02:01.785 --> 02:05.065
but I also fired my boss.

02:05.145 --> 02:07.145
Stupid boss. I don't
have to put up with him anymore.

02:07.225 --> 02:08.545
-Congratulations to me.
-Congratulations to you.

02:08.625 --> 02:09.545
Congratulations!

02:14.105 --> 02:17.225
That saying
by what's-his-name is so right.

02:18.185 --> 02:20.465
"You hold the sail of your future."

02:21.065 --> 02:25.345
I've decided that tomorrow,
I'll start my own business.

02:25.425 --> 02:30.065
You don't find flatmates
who fight with you in Beijing every day.

02:30.705 --> 02:32.705
I am a lucky girl.

02:33.625 --> 02:37.985
Don't laugh at me, but at work,
I keep getting the short end of the stick,

02:38.065 --> 02:39.625
but when I see the three of you

02:40.465 --> 02:43.585
at home, all my misery disappears.

02:44.265 --> 02:45.745
It doesn't affect me anymore.

02:46.585 --> 02:49.465
-What's the big deal?
-Yeah. What's the big deal?

02:49.545 --> 02:52.585
Even if the four of us
don't live together anymore,

02:53.865 --> 02:55.945
-our bond will not break.
-It won't.

02:57.225 --> 02:59.025
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

03:00.105 --> 03:00.985
Cheers.

03:07.025 --> 03:09.465
Just what have we done this year?

03:09.545 --> 03:12.105
And we end the year with bruises.

03:12.185 --> 03:14.745
It's a crazy ending to a year well spent.

03:16.385 --> 03:18.785
We have experienced
both the good and the bad.

03:21.545 --> 03:23.265
-We deserve a celebration.
-Yes, we do.

03:25.025 --> 03:26.625
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

03:29.185 --> 03:31.425
That day, we drank a lot.

03:32.865 --> 03:35.545
The boys puked everywhere.

03:39.025 --> 03:42.585
Life forces us to be invincible.

03:45.025 --> 03:47.945
But everything will come to an end.

03:49.545 --> 03:51.865
People come and go.

03:56.025 --> 03:59.105
TWO PERSONS, ONE HEART

04:04.545 --> 04:07.345
Come. Let me pet you. Let me pet you.

04:08.305 --> 04:09.385
Good boy.

04:09.465 --> 04:10.665
Good boy.

04:11.185 --> 04:11.905
Shang Zhitao.

04:13.105 --> 04:14.385
This is your new flatmate?

04:17.105 --> 04:19.184
He's not staying at my home.
Take him away.

04:20.545 --> 04:22.665
Luan Nian, are you afraid of dogs?

04:23.625 --> 04:27.145
But I promised the pet store owner
that I'd take him away today.

04:33.065 --> 04:33.985
He stinks.

04:34.585 --> 04:35.745
No, he doesn't.

04:37.305 --> 04:38.345
No, you don't.

04:40.225 --> 04:42.065
-What's his name?
-What?

04:42.745 --> 04:44.785
What is your stupid dog's name?

04:46.585 --> 04:47.745
He's…

04:49.345 --> 04:51.025
His name is Dog.

04:53.065 --> 04:54.345
A stupid name by a stupid person.

04:58.185 --> 05:01.145
Once we're home, he'll stay
in the garage or on the balcony.

05:01.905 --> 05:02.745
No.

05:02.825 --> 05:04.265
He stays where I live.

05:04.345 --> 05:07.305
Or I'll move to the balcony or the garage.

05:14.825 --> 05:17.345
He can move in,
but make sure he stays away from me.

05:19.425 --> 05:22.105
Don't worry. He's an introvert.
He won't approach you.

05:26.225 --> 05:27.505
Good boy.

05:31.985 --> 05:34.225
Verified. Please open the door.

05:50.225 --> 05:51.145
Go.

05:58.505 --> 06:00.305
You never use the bags I bought you.

06:03.265 --> 06:05.625
I can't bring myself to open them.
Maybe in the future.

06:05.705 --> 06:07.945
In the future, I'll use them.

06:12.025 --> 06:12.945
Move.

06:15.025 --> 06:15.985
Introvert, you say?

06:18.345 --> 06:20.545
Can't you read his face?

06:20.625 --> 06:22.665
Can't you see if someone likes
or hates you?

06:23.625 --> 06:26.545
Don't just approach anyone.
He doesn't like you. Understood?

06:28.185 --> 06:29.505
He will not step on my rug.

06:30.785 --> 06:32.705
I'm warning you. Stay away from me.

06:32.785 --> 06:34.105
If you piss me off, I'll hit you.

06:36.905 --> 06:38.705
Don't go there. Come.

06:42.265 --> 06:44.145
Luke. Come here.

06:44.225 --> 06:45.905
Luke, don't move.

06:47.465 --> 06:49.825
Come here. Quick.

06:55.025 --> 06:55.985
Who are you calling?

07:01.385 --> 07:02.785
What did you just call him?

07:04.985 --> 07:06.105
I called him…

07:07.585 --> 07:08.985
Dog.

07:09.065 --> 07:10.665
What is his true name?

07:13.465 --> 07:14.465
Luke.

07:17.625 --> 07:20.985
This stupid pet of yours is called Luke?

07:31.905 --> 07:33.425
-Luan Nian!
-Go away.

07:46.345 --> 07:48.345
-Luan Nian.
-Get out.

07:53.905 --> 07:54.785
Get out.

07:58.305 --> 07:59.545
I named him Luke

07:59.625 --> 08:03.665
because that was the first thing
that came into my mind.

08:03.745 --> 08:06.905
And I think it's a great name.
It rolls off your tongue.

08:08.545 --> 08:13.025
And I hope Luke
can keep me company every day.

08:25.385 --> 08:26.705
You can't call him Luke.

08:30.905 --> 08:32.305
Fine. I'll change the name.

08:33.985 --> 08:35.105
I'll call him

08:35.865 --> 08:36.865
Alex.

08:38.065 --> 08:41.264
What do you think? Alex is not bad.

08:46.065 --> 08:48.425
Whatever. I don't care.

08:48.505 --> 08:50.305
Luke it is, then.

08:50.385 --> 08:51.505
Come, Luke.

08:51.585 --> 08:54.625
Say hello to Uncle Luan. Uncle Luan.

08:54.705 --> 08:55.825
Uncle Luan.

08:55.905 --> 08:57.465
He calls you sister, but calls me uncle?

08:58.225 --> 08:59.785
How does that make sense?

08:59.865 --> 09:01.665
Just look at him. Touch him.

09:01.745 --> 09:03.745
Touch him, please. He's so cute.

09:03.825 --> 09:05.345
Touch him.

09:05.425 --> 09:06.305
Luke.

09:07.985 --> 09:09.425
Look how blank-faced he is.

09:11.425 --> 09:12.865
Don't stare at me. I'm talking about you.

09:13.465 --> 09:14.745
Ignore him.

09:17.785 --> 09:19.505
Silly dog who sheds.

09:21.025 --> 09:21.945
Useless.

09:24.505 --> 09:27.545
All right, Luke. Go play over there.

09:31.945 --> 09:34.585
All right. Luke, go play over there.

09:37.745 --> 09:39.225
Don't yell at him.

09:42.145 --> 09:44.025
Don't yell at him.

09:47.745 --> 09:51.505
You look so scary. Don't be like that.

09:51.585 --> 09:52.465
Don't.

09:56.105 --> 09:57.385
Hug. Hugs.

09:58.305 --> 10:01.945
Luke is so sweet. Don't be mean to him.

10:18.225 --> 10:19.065
Luke.

10:20.225 --> 10:21.225
Shang Zhitao.

10:21.745 --> 10:23.825
Take your stupid dog
and get out of my room.

10:24.865 --> 10:26.505
Okay. Luke.

10:29.305 --> 10:30.145
Then I'll sleep with him

10:31.145 --> 10:32.185
in the guest room.

10:32.785 --> 10:34.785
I have to wake up early tomorrow anyway.

10:35.385 --> 10:38.225
It's the weekend.
Why do you need to wake up early?

10:38.305 --> 10:39.945
I have a French class.

10:40.025 --> 10:41.985
And I need to check out
new apartments with my flatmates.

10:46.105 --> 10:48.425
Do you go on a date
with that foreigner every weekend?

10:49.505 --> 10:51.425
It's a tuition class.

10:52.185 --> 10:53.025
Come, Luke.

10:54.425 --> 10:55.465
Luke.

10:55.985 --> 10:57.305
Goodnight, Luke.

11:08.585 --> 11:09.505
A tuition class?

11:12.265 --> 11:13.105
Okay.

11:13.945 --> 11:14.785
J'ai hâte…

11:15.665 --> 11:16.945
J'ai hâte…

11:17.025 --> 11:18.585
…de collaborer…

11:18.665 --> 11:20.345
…de collaborer…

11:20.425 --> 11:21.465
…avec vous.

11:21.545 --> 11:22.425
…avec vous.

11:22.505 --> 11:25.305
J'ai hâte de collaborer avec vous.

11:25.385 --> 11:28.945
J'ai hâte de collaborer avec vous.

11:30.265 --> 11:31.385
I look forward to working with you.

11:31.465 --> 11:33.945
I look forward to working with you.

11:34.745 --> 11:35.905
C'est génial.

11:35.985 --> 11:37.985
Great. You learn faster than I do.

11:38.065 --> 11:39.025
Merci.

11:44.545 --> 11:45.785
Hello, Sun Yu.

11:45.865 --> 11:47.345
Hey, Tao.

11:48.065 --> 11:49.585
I'll be done soon.

11:49.665 --> 11:50.985
Which apartment are we viewing today?

11:51.065 --> 11:53.225
No need for that anymore.

11:53.305 --> 11:54.505
The housing is sorted out.

11:54.585 --> 11:55.985
We don't need to move anymore.

11:56.545 --> 11:58.025
-Lei, you tell her.
-Who?

11:58.105 --> 12:00.385
-Tao.
-Tao. Tao.

12:00.465 --> 12:03.545
My friends lent me some money.
I bought back my ex-wife's property.

12:03.625 --> 12:05.745
You don't need to find another home.
Just come home.

12:05.825 --> 12:07.545
We can all go home
and celebrate Chinese New Year.

12:07.625 --> 12:10.025
You hear that? Come home.

12:10.105 --> 12:12.425
That's great! Long Zhentian.

12:12.505 --> 12:15.425
I don't have to move away.
We don't have to be apart.

12:15.945 --> 12:17.785
-C'est la vie.
-C'est la vie.

12:18.745 --> 12:20.465
That's great!

12:21.065 --> 12:21.785
Again.

12:21.865 --> 12:23.105
-J'ai hâte
-J'ai hâte

12:23.185 --> 12:24.625
de collaborer…

12:24.705 --> 12:26.025
de collaborer…

12:33.425 --> 12:34.825
I'm back.

12:34.905 --> 12:35.745
You're back.

12:35.825 --> 12:37.785
-So many things.
-You're back, Tao.

12:37.865 --> 12:38.865
Yes.

12:38.945 --> 12:40.665
-We're unpacking.
-Where do I put this?

12:40.745 --> 12:42.985
-Lei.
-Tao, you're back.

12:43.065 --> 12:44.825
I didn't know we had
this many things until we had to move out.

12:44.905 --> 12:48.745
Now that all of us are here,
allow me to say "Welcome Home."

12:49.425 --> 12:50.265
One more thing.

12:50.345 --> 12:52.425
This will be our home, now and forever.

12:53.025 --> 12:53.945
Yeah!

12:54.025 --> 12:55.425
This is wonderful.

12:55.505 --> 12:58.225
There's nothing like home.

12:58.305 --> 13:00.905
I was thinking of getting
a longer dining table.

13:00.985 --> 13:03.025
That way, we can work at the same place.

13:03.105 --> 13:04.225
Good.

13:04.305 --> 13:06.265
We can redesign
the layout of the living room

13:06.345 --> 13:08.305
and replace the sofa and the bookshelf.

13:08.385 --> 13:12.105
I want to put two plant stands here.

13:12.185 --> 13:14.625
I'll buy some plants and flowers.

13:14.705 --> 13:17.785
And get a fishbowl. To bring in fortune.

13:17.865 --> 13:20.385
-We'll raise the fish together.
-I also want a pet.

13:20.465 --> 13:21.425
What kind of pet?

13:22.025 --> 13:23.425
I want a dog.

13:23.505 --> 13:24.545
A dog?

13:26.425 --> 13:28.625
Lei, are you afraid of dogs?

13:29.825 --> 13:32.425
-No way.
-Great.

13:33.145 --> 13:35.265
-Yuanzhu?
-I'm fine with dogs.

13:35.345 --> 13:36.425
Really?

13:36.505 --> 13:37.545
It's unanimous then.

13:37.625 --> 13:41.545
The Samoyed will be
the fifth member of this house.

13:41.625 --> 13:43.225
Field member?

13:43.305 --> 13:44.505
Fifth member.

13:44.585 --> 13:47.145
I heard field member. Come. Get to work.

13:47.225 --> 13:48.145
Stop messing around.

13:48.225 --> 13:49.905
My back is killing me.
Start unpacking now. Stop talking.

13:49.985 --> 13:51.665
-I'll take care of the window.
-Okay.

13:51.745 --> 13:52.865
Careful, Lei.

13:52.945 --> 13:53.905
I'm fine.

13:55.945 --> 13:57.745
Where do I hang this?

13:57.825 --> 13:58.905
Here.

13:59.785 --> 14:00.945
There's a nail here.

14:01.025 --> 14:02.665
Tao, check if it's centered.

14:03.265 --> 14:04.145
It's centered.

14:04.225 --> 14:05.985
Lei, can you carry the sofa with me?

14:06.065 --> 14:06.945
Sure.

14:10.545 --> 14:12.425
It's my third year in Beijing.

14:12.505 --> 14:15.545
I'm so incredibly lucky
to have moved into this unit.

14:16.905 --> 14:22.825
My flatmates in 301
are my family in Beijing.

14:23.505 --> 14:29.265
For the first time in my life,
this city feels like home.

14:38.265 --> 14:40.145
BE HAPPY TODAY

14:53.345 --> 14:54.745
It's a weekend flight.

14:55.905 --> 14:57.465
My annual leave
can last till the end of February.

14:57.545 --> 14:59.385
Wait.

14:59.465 --> 15:02.025
I hear a girl singing.

15:03.305 --> 15:04.385
Is that your girlfriend?

15:04.465 --> 15:05.945
I don't want to discuss this.

15:06.025 --> 15:08.225
I don't intend to bring her home.

15:08.825 --> 15:11.265
Is it because you're worried
your dad will give her a hard time?

15:11.865 --> 15:14.185
Don't worry. I'll talk to him.

15:15.345 --> 15:16.665
It's not yet the right time.

15:17.265 --> 15:20.745
All right. I'll let you decide.
I'll hang up now.

15:35.905 --> 15:38.185
Sorry. I didn't know
you were having a phone call.

15:38.785 --> 15:41.305
-I didn't mean to sing out loud.
-You're very happy today.

15:43.025 --> 15:45.025
My flatmates told me
we got the house back.

15:45.105 --> 15:46.545
I'll move back soon.

15:46.625 --> 15:48.665
Thank you for letting me
crash at your place.

15:53.145 --> 15:55.105
How much is your rent?

15:55.905 --> 15:56.945
Around 1,000 yuan.

15:57.985 --> 15:58.985
Rent a room with me.

15:59.745 --> 16:00.785
I'll charge you 500 yuan.

16:03.385 --> 16:04.505
Thanks,

16:04.585 --> 16:07.905
but I prefer to stay with my flatmates.
We agreed on it.

16:08.945 --> 16:10.985
Are you that reluctant
to leave your flatmates?

16:12.145 --> 16:13.385
They are all very kind.

16:14.585 --> 16:17.385
Congratulations then.
You found good flatmates.

16:29.345 --> 16:30.985
I don't intend to bring her home.

16:33.025 --> 16:34.105
It's not yet the right time.

17:22.184 --> 17:23.025
Thanks, my puppy.

17:26.145 --> 17:27.224
Come. Here.

18:02.145 --> 18:03.065
Why did you come out?

18:05.265 --> 18:06.385
To get some air.

18:12.225 --> 18:13.465
Silly dog.

18:13.545 --> 18:15.305
Come here. Come.

18:17.945 --> 18:19.225
-Luke.
-Your dog is quite strong.

18:20.305 --> 18:21.345
Sit.

18:26.545 --> 18:27.745
Come here.

18:28.585 --> 18:29.585
Sit.

18:30.105 --> 18:31.105
Lazy dog.

18:31.705 --> 18:33.385
He likes you a lot.

18:37.425 --> 18:38.465
Shang Zhitao.

18:39.905 --> 18:41.945
Let's go to the bar
in the mountains tomorrow.

18:45.065 --> 18:46.145
Okay.

18:49.385 --> 18:50.625
Let's go, silly dog.

18:51.385 --> 18:52.545
Let's go.

18:59.145 --> 19:01.665
-What do you think?
-The renovation is already done?

19:03.065 --> 19:04.305
It looks good.

19:07.425 --> 19:09.585
-Luke.
-Luke, come here.

19:14.905 --> 19:16.705
This is better than I imagined.

19:16.785 --> 19:17.705
Do you like it?

19:18.905 --> 19:20.745
I love your renovation choices.

19:24.185 --> 19:25.425
Let Luke roam freely.

19:26.025 --> 19:28.025
Go, Luke. Don't pee or poop anywhere.

19:28.105 --> 19:29.425
He won't.

19:36.745 --> 19:39.585
Once the glassware is here, you will
have the first drink from the bartender.

19:40.625 --> 19:42.585
When is the bartender coming?

19:49.065 --> 19:51.185
You know how to mix drinks?

19:52.425 --> 19:55.505
When this place opens to the public,
you will be our first client.

19:56.225 --> 19:58.145
And you shall witness my mixing skills.

19:58.745 --> 20:00.865
For the moment,
I can only make you sky juice.

20:02.185 --> 20:04.505
Sky juice? Just call it mineral water.

20:09.865 --> 20:10.945
Luke.

20:11.025 --> 20:12.505
Come and drink.

20:13.585 --> 20:14.465
Luke.

20:15.945 --> 20:16.985
Come. Luke.

20:36.825 --> 20:37.985
Don't drink this one for the opening day.

20:38.065 --> 20:40.345
My friend gave me a bottle
of 25-year-old whiskey.

20:40.425 --> 20:41.265
Allow me to introduce.

20:45.185 --> 20:46.465
This is Shang Zhitao.

20:47.785 --> 20:48.985
I don't have to introduce myself.

20:49.065 --> 20:50.505
I've already met her.

20:51.025 --> 20:53.425
This is our first meeting.
I am Song Qiuhan.

20:53.505 --> 20:56.265
We are Luke's best friends from school.

20:56.345 --> 20:58.785
Listen. I've known him for many years,

20:58.865 --> 21:01.785
and this is the first time
he has introduced his girlfriend to us.

21:05.345 --> 21:07.025
Come, Ms. Shang.

21:09.025 --> 21:10.865
What an honor.

21:11.465 --> 21:12.385
I finally met you.

21:12.985 --> 21:14.825
-Now that I've met you…
-Are you out of your mind?

21:14.905 --> 21:17.345
Now that I've met you, I see you
not only raise a good dog,

21:18.065 --> 21:19.945
but also do a good job managing Luke.

21:20.025 --> 21:22.665
Are you sick? What are you trying to say?

21:22.745 --> 21:24.145
I'm saying you are obedient.

21:25.225 --> 21:27.905
When it comes to obedience,
no one can outdo a simp like you.

21:29.665 --> 21:30.745
We're the same.

21:34.985 --> 21:38.585
Luke, what made you decide
to open a bar here?

21:38.665 --> 21:40.985
Even if it doesn't make any money,
won't you want to recoup your cost?

21:41.585 --> 21:43.185
Exactly. It's a remote place.

21:43.265 --> 21:45.025
How is it going to be successful?

21:46.585 --> 21:48.065
Speaking of business,

21:50.065 --> 21:52.865
all of you have a share in this bar.

21:53.585 --> 21:54.425
A surprise?

21:56.505 --> 21:58.465
Share Purchase Agreement.

21:58.545 --> 22:00.185
What is the meaning of this?

22:00.265 --> 22:02.625
Does this mean we will be jointly liable
if this business fails?

22:03.785 --> 22:05.265
This bar is not open to the public,

22:05.785 --> 22:06.825
but it's fully booked this week.

22:07.505 --> 22:10.145
The Anns from Fumei Group
and Ruixing Group

22:10.225 --> 22:11.985
will be here for an event
in the next two days.

22:12.065 --> 22:15.065
Next week, the newly appointed
Mr. Guan of Yuanjing will be here.

22:16.305 --> 22:18.025
It's not open to the public,

22:19.385 --> 22:23.025
meaning it's like a private club.

22:24.945 --> 22:26.785
-See?
-It seems like we are too shortsighted.

22:26.865 --> 22:30.625
When it comes to running a bar,
you are much better than Song.

22:30.705 --> 22:32.545
I didn't know
you had such business acumen.

22:32.625 --> 22:34.585
Otherwise, I really should have asked you
to run my bar back then.

22:35.625 --> 22:36.865
Why should I work for you?

22:36.945 --> 22:38.465
Right. You'll be the boss.

22:39.505 --> 22:41.345
-I wouldn't have lost so much money.
-Exactly.

22:41.425 --> 22:43.265
-Come.
-Drink up.

22:43.345 --> 22:44.225
Come.

23:11.265 --> 23:12.425
Allow me to introduce.

23:12.505 --> 23:14.345
This is Shang Zhitao.

23:14.425 --> 23:15.425
I've known him for many years,

23:15.505 --> 23:18.625
and this is the first time
he has introduced his girlfriend to us.

23:55.145 --> 24:01.105
THANK YOU FOR YOUR HOSPITALITY
SORRY FOR THE TROUBLE!

24:05.785 --> 24:08.985
HARBIN

24:09.065 --> 24:10.025
LAOLIANGKOU RESTAURANT

24:10.105 --> 24:11.145
Here it is.

24:11.745 --> 24:13.865
Luke, I'll take you to visit relatives
on Chinese New Year's Day.

24:15.305 --> 24:16.345
Coming.

24:16.425 --> 24:17.745
-Wow.
-Two more dishes.

24:17.825 --> 24:19.225
-Hey, my good boy.
-Come.

24:19.305 --> 24:20.505
Have you learned
how to bow with your paws?

24:20.585 --> 24:23.585
If you have, you'll get the red envelopes,

24:23.665 --> 24:25.145
and then, I'll buy meat for you.

24:25.905 --> 24:28.225
Mom, don't feed him meat.
He'll eat kibble.

24:28.305 --> 24:29.345
Meat is too salty.

24:29.945 --> 24:32.425
Luke, Grandpa will light firecrackers
with you later.

24:32.505 --> 24:34.625
Grandpa? Dad, you sure are eager
to be a grandpa.

24:34.705 --> 24:36.185
He's one of our family members.

24:37.545 --> 24:38.745
Come. It's all your favorite.

24:38.825 --> 24:40.985
-Aren't they good?
-They are perfect.

24:41.065 --> 24:42.345
-Dig in.
-Dig in.

24:42.425 --> 24:44.305
I'm heading to Suzhou
after Chinese New Year

24:44.385 --> 24:45.425
for more than two months
for my business trip.

24:45.505 --> 24:47.665
-I have to eat more now.
-Come. Dig in.

24:47.745 --> 24:51.025
-You've worked hard, Tao.
-Come. Look.

24:56.625 --> 24:57.465
Come.

24:57.545 --> 24:58.425
Cheers.

25:01.385 --> 25:02.225
Oh.

25:03.105 --> 25:06.105
Last night, Zang Yao came to me.

25:06.185 --> 25:09.105
She was drunk, and she cried a lot.

25:09.705 --> 25:12.865
She said she wanted to let go of you.

25:13.545 --> 25:15.145
Like for real this time.

25:16.905 --> 25:18.625
It'll only do her good.

25:18.705 --> 25:21.225
She said she finally realized

25:21.305 --> 25:23.865
that Shang Zhitao was special to you.

25:23.945 --> 25:25.985
She has never seen you like this before.

25:28.945 --> 25:30.385
I know why you did what you did,

25:30.465 --> 25:33.345
but we grew up with Zang Yao.

25:33.425 --> 25:35.545
You could have been kinder to her.

25:35.625 --> 25:38.545
What? Is giving her
false hopes kindness now?

25:39.265 --> 25:42.785
All right. Stop criticizing Luan Nian.

25:42.865 --> 25:45.345
Luke. Tell us honestly.

25:45.865 --> 25:47.745
Is this a serious relationship or not?

25:48.505 --> 25:49.545
I've never fooled around
with my relationships.

25:50.905 --> 25:52.265
Right.

25:52.345 --> 25:54.825
How come you didn't bring
Ms. Shang home for Chinese New Year?

25:55.945 --> 25:59.025
-It's none of your business.
-Okay.

26:06.505 --> 26:07.945
Happy Chinese New Year.

26:08.025 --> 26:09.625
I wish you well.

26:10.265 --> 26:12.905
Happy Chinese New Year.
May your Luke grow bigger.

26:13.585 --> 26:15.105
Happy Chinese New Year. Cheers.

26:15.185 --> 26:16.585
-Come. Happy Chinese New Year.
-Happy Chinese New Year.

26:16.665 --> 26:18.705
Happy Chinese New Year.

26:29.065 --> 26:31.145
ONE MONTH LATER, SUZHOU

26:53.305 --> 26:54.545
-Just put it here.
-Sure.

26:54.625 --> 26:55.785
Thank you so much.

26:55.865 --> 26:57.185
You and Yuanzhu went on a business trip.

26:57.265 --> 26:58.785
I'll take care of our home. Don't worry.

26:58.865 --> 27:00.105
I'm taking good care of Luke as well.

27:00.185 --> 27:01.785
I knew I could count on you.

27:01.865 --> 27:03.105
Luan Nian will be here soon.

27:03.185 --> 27:05.145
-I'm waiting for him here.
-Okay.

27:05.225 --> 27:06.185
-I will be home soon.
-Flora.

27:06.905 --> 27:08.185
Mr. Wang.

27:08.265 --> 27:09.945
You have worked hard in the past month.

27:10.025 --> 27:11.625
I heard Luke would be here.

27:11.705 --> 27:13.265
-Yes. He…
-Flora.

27:30.865 --> 27:32.585
Morning, Luke.

27:34.265 --> 27:36.065
This is Mr. Wang
from the event management company.

27:36.145 --> 27:37.505
This is our boss, Luke.

27:38.665 --> 27:39.665
You must have had a long journey.

27:40.545 --> 27:42.465
I'll book a private room
to treat you and Flora

27:42.545 --> 27:44.865
-to a meal.
-Sure.

27:44.945 --> 27:46.665
But we can have the meal anytime.

27:46.745 --> 27:48.705
We have a conference soon.

27:51.305 --> 27:52.385
How is the progress?

27:52.905 --> 27:53.865
The setup is almost done.

27:53.945 --> 27:56.345
The guest reception
has been duly arranged.

27:56.425 --> 27:58.905
The rehearsal will begin at 3 p.m.

28:00.105 --> 28:02.065
Go to the venue
and double-check the schedule.

28:02.145 --> 28:04.025
Then, bring your team with you
for a meeting.

28:05.465 --> 28:06.785
I shall wait for you two at the venue.

28:06.865 --> 28:08.585
Let me know if you need me.

28:29.105 --> 28:30.905
I think your creative proposal

28:30.985 --> 28:32.825
does not align
with the client's strategic direction.

28:32.905 --> 28:34.345
What do the people think on your end?

28:34.985 --> 28:35.945
Well, Mr. Luan.

28:36.585 --> 28:39.905
Let me bring you up to speed
regarding our comments.

28:40.505 --> 28:43.465
We are now pushing
for a collaboration with the brand.

28:43.545 --> 28:46.745
We hope to leverage their resources
to increase our visibility.

28:46.825 --> 28:49.265
It's cheap and boosts our visibility.

28:49.345 --> 28:51.505
The client wants us
to expand the target audience

28:52.105 --> 28:53.505
to the younger generation.

28:53.585 --> 28:54.865
-So the idea
-Bring me a bottle of water.

28:54.945 --> 28:56.265
has to be surprising.

28:56.345 --> 29:00.585
Given the current media trend,
we can use videos,

29:00.665 --> 29:04.225
product placements,
or targeted placement in vertical markets.

29:04.305 --> 29:05.665
It's sort of like digital menus.

29:06.505 --> 29:08.665
But we also have a more traditional idea,

29:08.745 --> 29:10.945
which is more aligned
with the brand's direction.

29:11.025 --> 29:11.945
Carry on.

29:12.025 --> 29:13.105
Working with online content,

29:13.185 --> 29:15.945
we have selected five major influencers
on Weibo whose tone matches our brand

29:16.025 --> 29:17.545
and bloggers in vertical fields.

29:17.625 --> 29:21.745
They cover fashion, lifestyle,
tech, and digital products.

29:21.825 --> 29:24.505
As for the frequency,
we allocate three days to build hype,

29:24.585 --> 29:26.625
two days for peak days,
and one week for the long tail period.

29:27.305 --> 29:32.665
We will send you the influencer
fan profiles and audience overlap data

29:32.745 --> 29:34.065
with our target brand audience by tonight.

29:34.705 --> 29:38.065
As for physical events, we have come up
with three interactive segments.

29:38.145 --> 29:39.985
The first one is a flash mob.

29:40.065 --> 29:43.825
The second is a QR code
that unlocks our brand's history.

29:43.905 --> 29:45.505
And the third one is the Weibo mega screen

29:45.585 --> 29:47.465
-Take the meeting minutes.
-that visitors can interact with.

29:47.545 --> 29:50.905
We estimate more
than 3,000 visitors per show.

29:50.985 --> 29:52.065
I see.

29:52.745 --> 29:54.825
I think we can swap the order
of these two proposals.

29:55.425 --> 29:56.265
Okay.

30:07.785 --> 30:09.745
It's around 7 p.m. now.
Let's take a break.

30:09.825 --> 30:11.745
-A 40-minute dinner break.
-Okay.

30:11.825 --> 30:14.145
-We'll continue after the meal.
-Hello. It's the food delivery.

30:19.345 --> 30:20.185
Pardon me.

30:24.665 --> 30:25.785
Enjoy your meal.

30:27.145 --> 30:28.185
Thank you.

30:29.065 --> 30:30.185
Let's eat.

30:44.465 --> 30:45.505
Did you miss me?

30:52.105 --> 30:53.945
You've been on this business trip
for a long time.

30:55.145 --> 30:56.145
Have you ever missed me?

31:27.825 --> 31:30.545
Is everyone here? Let's begin.

31:30.625 --> 31:35.505
Sure, Mr. Luan. So, we chose
a venue next to Taihu Lake this time.

31:35.585 --> 31:38.385
It fits perfectly with this year's
Traditional Chinese-style initiative,

31:38.465 --> 31:41.145
the localization of international brands,

31:41.225 --> 31:44.585
and the brand's re-invigoration
of traditional culture.

31:44.665 --> 31:47.225
They are trending topics at the moment.

31:47.745 --> 31:51.785
And the latest strategy in Lime China
is to study the local culture

31:51.865 --> 31:53.265
to bring out the Chinese spirit.

31:53.345 --> 31:54.385
Tell me more about the itinerary.

31:54.465 --> 31:56.505
Please confirm
the subsequent marketing plans

31:56.585 --> 31:59.065
-with me today as well.
-I will send the itinerary to you soon.

31:59.145 --> 32:00.145
As for the marketing plans,

32:00.225 --> 32:01.385
we will conduct a survey
with the Creative Division

32:01.465 --> 32:02.465
before finalizing them.

32:02.545 --> 32:05.785
All right. Good work.
That's all for today's meeting.

32:05.865 --> 32:06.905
Sure.

32:17.065 --> 32:18.305
Hello?

32:18.385 --> 32:20.505
The headquarters are planning
to bring in a general manager.

32:20.585 --> 32:21.585
Are you aware of it?

32:26.225 --> 32:27.145
We'll speak later.

32:33.105 --> 32:33.945
I have to go now.

32:36.025 --> 32:36.865
You won't stay here?

32:39.105 --> 32:40.185
No.

32:40.265 --> 32:44.585
I need to check on the progress
and write the work report.

32:47.865 --> 32:50.465
Do you know how to write one?
Do you need my help?

32:52.265 --> 32:53.185
No need.

32:53.705 --> 32:55.985
I don't need your help
to get my promotion.

32:56.585 --> 32:58.425
Thank you for the offer, Mr. Luan.

32:59.105 --> 33:00.865
I'll send you some insider websites later.

33:00.945 --> 33:02.545
Other than working hard,

33:02.625 --> 33:04.745
knowing how to demonstrate
your growth and achievement

33:04.825 --> 33:07.105
is very important at work as well.

33:15.505 --> 33:16.985
Are you actually helping me?

33:19.585 --> 33:20.465
Shang Zhitao.

33:22.625 --> 33:23.945
I hope you'll get the promotion

33:24.945 --> 33:26.665
because you have achieved many things

33:27.665 --> 33:28.705
and have a great working attitude.

33:30.385 --> 33:33.265
Your brain is also better than before.

33:37.625 --> 33:39.105
Is that a compliment?

33:40.625 --> 33:42.585
Didn't you tell me
to compliment you occasionally?

34:07.825 --> 34:08.744
Tao.

34:09.385 --> 34:10.585
You're finally back.

34:11.105 --> 34:13.385
Your business trip was so long.
How was it?

34:13.465 --> 34:14.545
It was okay.

34:16.585 --> 34:17.425
What?

34:20.945 --> 34:22.865
We have a new general manager now.

34:22.945 --> 34:24.385
He's on the same level as Luke.

34:26.585 --> 34:28.784
-What do you mean?
-His name is Dony.

34:28.865 --> 34:31.065
A pretentious elite who returned to China.

34:31.145 --> 34:33.625
Apparently, the board sent him here.

34:33.705 --> 34:34.705
I did my research.

34:34.784 --> 34:36.824
His resume is as impressive as Luke's.

34:36.905 --> 34:38.705
There's a rumor recently saying

34:38.784 --> 34:40.225
that Luan Nian will become
the general manager.

34:40.304 --> 34:41.585
Then, he suddenly appears.

34:42.425 --> 34:43.585
It's fishy.

34:45.225 --> 34:46.784
They don't want Luke
to become too powerful.

34:46.865 --> 34:48.185
They want to keep him in check.

34:49.065 --> 34:51.105
It's not a good thing, I'm sure.

34:56.185 --> 34:59.265
What is your opinion regarding
the investment ratio of the new media?

34:59.945 --> 35:03.385
I think we can study the recent--

35:05.505 --> 35:06.985
Sorry for the interruption.

35:07.745 --> 35:09.145
Allow me to introduce.

35:09.225 --> 35:11.545
This is the new general manager
of the Business Division,

35:11.625 --> 35:14.305
Dony. He will be in charge
of the new media marketing strategy.

35:15.225 --> 35:16.305
Welcome on board.

35:19.385 --> 35:21.345
The headquarters wants him
to join today's meeting.

35:21.945 --> 35:23.545
I'll let you guys work.

35:27.585 --> 35:29.745
Luke. I've heard about you.

35:30.505 --> 35:31.625
I look forward to working with you.

35:32.145 --> 35:33.305
Likewise.

35:34.465 --> 35:36.585
We were talking about next year's
new media marketing proposal.

35:36.665 --> 35:37.745
Join us.

35:38.265 --> 35:40.905
I've read the proposal before I came here.

35:40.985 --> 35:44.825
I think it can use some new ideas.

35:45.745 --> 35:47.785
We are now in the digital era.

35:48.625 --> 35:50.025
Independent media outlets
have become influential.

35:50.105 --> 35:55.145
The interaction between users
and media shouldn't remain unchanged.

35:55.745 --> 36:00.345
We must inject new life into the image
for better user interaction

36:00.425 --> 36:02.825
and retention rate. Don't you agree?

36:07.905 --> 36:08.745
Right.

36:09.345 --> 36:11.145
You want an A/B test.

36:11.225 --> 36:14.025
We at Lime support new strategies
and different perspectives.

36:14.705 --> 36:15.545
I look forward to reading your proposal.

36:16.745 --> 36:17.745
Thank you, Luke.

36:18.265 --> 36:19.785
Let's go over this again.

36:20.545 --> 36:21.585
Sure. Carry on without me.

36:22.265 --> 36:23.945
I have a meeting later, don't I?

36:25.745 --> 36:29.225
And welcome. Familiarize yourself
with our work.

36:29.305 --> 36:32.265
If you have time,
you can take a walk outside too.

36:32.345 --> 36:33.545
Beijing has changed a lot.

36:46.185 --> 36:47.585
You must be Flora.

36:49.225 --> 36:50.465
Dony.

36:50.545 --> 36:54.665
I was told you handled the cases
regarding new media marketing.

36:56.945 --> 37:01.505
I need to relaunch several projects.
Can you help me?

37:03.105 --> 37:06.145
Sure. Let me know if you need me.

37:06.225 --> 37:07.625
I definitely need your assistance.

37:08.625 --> 37:11.225
I'll ask my division to send you
the meeting notification as well.

37:11.825 --> 37:15.185
Do it well. I have plenty of opportunities
for you to shine.

37:16.305 --> 37:18.945
-Okay.
-Go back to your work.

37:25.505 --> 37:26.705
Dony?

37:29.465 --> 37:30.585
Why him of all people?

37:31.425 --> 37:32.785
And parachuted into the office as well?

37:36.305 --> 37:38.265
He's up to no good.

37:38.345 --> 37:40.185
What rotten luck.

37:41.825 --> 37:43.585
Luan Nian has a history with him.

37:45.665 --> 37:47.465
I told you that a guy
betrayed Luan Nian back then.

37:48.345 --> 37:49.705
He was that guy.

37:52.345 --> 37:53.985
They are our rivals.

37:54.585 --> 37:55.745
What did they offer you?

37:56.345 --> 37:59.145
You took my core idea as your ticket in.

37:59.225 --> 38:01.305
I spent three months working on it.

38:06.745 --> 38:07.745
What is the meaning of this?

38:08.585 --> 38:10.825
You can't say it was your effort alone.

38:10.905 --> 38:13.345
I was the one who dealt with the client.

38:13.945 --> 38:15.865
If you don't want to work with me,
you may leave.

38:16.385 --> 38:17.425
The company can be closed down.

38:17.505 --> 38:20.145
But you took my core idea
and sold it to our rivals

38:20.225 --> 38:23.025
to use it against me. Now that's betrayal.

38:23.625 --> 38:24.865
Do you have no shame?

38:25.945 --> 38:27.145
We were brothers.

38:27.705 --> 38:29.185
I do not think I did you wrong.

38:29.265 --> 38:32.505
You know very well this company
has burned through all its cash.

38:33.105 --> 38:35.465
Yes, you are rich,

38:35.545 --> 38:36.705
but I'm not.

38:37.305 --> 38:38.385
I cannot run on an empty stomach

38:38.465 --> 38:41.145
to waste time with you
on your so-called pursuit of perfection.

38:41.665 --> 38:43.865
The priority for this company
is to survive.

38:43.945 --> 38:45.545
You're committing a crime.

38:46.505 --> 38:47.545
I'm seeking legal action.

38:58.785 --> 39:02.145
I really hate that you always
put on that artist act.

39:02.785 --> 39:04.105
You think you're the only genius?

39:04.185 --> 39:08.665
Without me, your unrealistic idea
has no value.

39:08.745 --> 39:10.545
It's just a pipe dream. Do you get it?

39:12.265 --> 39:13.545
Whether it's a pipe dream or not

39:14.145 --> 39:16.265
does not mean
I can't kick you out of this place.

39:25.625 --> 39:26.945
‎WHISPERING PEAKS CREATIVE STUDIO

39:37.585 --> 39:39.425
I didn't want to tell you all this,

39:39.945 --> 39:43.585
but I know you are special to Luke.

39:45.105 --> 39:47.745
As you already know, he is a prideful man.

39:48.265 --> 39:51.305
Even though you now know the story,
do not bring it up in front of him.

40:15.945 --> 40:17.385
Can you mix a drink for me?

40:37.825 --> 40:38.985
A special drink.

40:41.625 --> 40:42.625
What is it called?

40:43.625 --> 40:44.785
It has no name.

40:44.865 --> 40:46.225
No name?

40:47.345 --> 40:48.425
I'll name it then.

40:50.025 --> 40:51.465
Let's call it

40:52.225 --> 40:53.345
One Heart.

40:58.665 --> 40:59.945
What are you getting at?

41:01.545 --> 41:05.305
Lumi told me that Dony
had a complicated background.

41:06.025 --> 41:09.025
Not only did he ask me
to join his new project,

41:09.625 --> 41:12.185
but he also asked several other
key employees to join him.

41:13.985 --> 41:16.465
That's work for you.
Things are not simple.

41:17.665 --> 41:20.105
If someone asks you to pick a side,
will you do it?

41:20.945 --> 41:23.505
Pick his side,
and I might become your enemy.

41:23.585 --> 41:26.025
If you don't, you might be eliminated.

41:28.945 --> 41:30.425
I will never betray you.

41:36.225 --> 41:37.585
And I will never
put my guard up against you.

41:46.225 --> 41:49.065
Oh. I have a business trip in two days.

41:49.145 --> 41:51.545
Can you look after Luke for me?

41:52.865 --> 41:55.305
No. Because I might cook him.

41:57.185 --> 41:58.465
Sure.

41:59.025 --> 42:00.625
Why don't you cook me first?

42:00.705 --> 42:02.225
Cook me first, then cook him next.

42:02.305 --> 42:04.945
You're not delicious
because you lack a brain.

42:09.385 --> 42:10.425
You…

42:11.545 --> 42:13.625
That won't work, Shang Zhitao.

42:15.265 --> 42:16.185
No.

42:17.145 --> 42:18.785
Please.

42:19.825 --> 42:21.705
Take care of him, please?

42:22.585 --> 42:24.745
If he pees in my room, I'll smack him.

42:25.585 --> 42:28.105
If he bites my things, I'll smack him too.

42:29.625 --> 42:32.585
Okay. He needs
to be responsible for his actions.

42:32.665 --> 42:33.905
Smack him.

42:37.705 --> 42:39.185
Do you like it?

42:40.745 --> 42:43.745
I can take three of it
without any problem.

42:43.825 --> 42:45.905
Aren't I amazing? Have I improved myself?

42:45.985 --> 42:47.425
Of everything you can improve on,

42:47.945 --> 42:49.065
you picked drinking?

42:49.145 --> 42:52.425
What if I had to drink at a social event?

42:52.505 --> 42:54.225
I would hold my drinks better than before.

42:54.305 --> 42:56.225
Drinking is never mandatory
at any social event.

42:56.745 --> 42:58.585
Remember what I told you?

43:00.185 --> 43:01.025
Yes.

43:01.665 --> 43:03.665
Turn down drinks if I can.

43:04.465 --> 43:06.425
I don't like it
when you drink with someone else.

43:09.785 --> 43:10.905
Can you do that for me?

43:11.785 --> 43:12.785
Okay.

43:14.265 --> 43:15.105
Pinky promise.

43:15.825 --> 43:17.865
Whoever tells a lie

43:17.945 --> 43:19.065
-will sink to the bad place.
-You're crazy.

43:26.225 --> 43:28.785
NORTHWESTERN CHINA

43:38.505 --> 43:39.985
Hello, Yuanzhu.

43:41.985 --> 43:44.225
I have come to your region!

44:20.225 --> 44:21.625
Luke!

44:42.985 --> 44:45.505
Hongqi has put on some weight.

44:53.465 --> 44:57.065
I feel the atmosphere
at the office has been weird lately.

44:57.865 --> 44:59.545
Everyone has been gossiping.

45:03.825 --> 45:05.145
Focus on your work.

45:06.145 --> 45:07.865
Don't worry about other things.

45:08.545 --> 45:09.625
Don't get yourself involved.

45:13.145 --> 45:14.265
Yes.

45:14.785 --> 45:18.345
Because I'm small and insignificant.
Who am I to worry about everything?

45:25.225 --> 45:26.185
You're small.

45:27.145 --> 45:28.065
But not insignificant.
